{"skill":{"slug":"mcp-skill","displayName":"Mcp Skill"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769421092406,"changelog":"Initial release of the mcp-skill.\n\n- Provides a wrapper for MCP tools at https://mcp.exa.ai/mcp.\n- Includes tools for web search, deep research, code context, web crawling, company research, and LinkedIn search.","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"README.md","size":10,"sha256":"42bd1e3ba49b6ff4e248f54988adc84136ba27a1a875b5a2ad557bf672395988","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":338,"sha256":"ad34eec5a647c02821d0b3e5b267c94145eff596fad11ce7e8d583575dc8e45a","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1561,"sha256":"63f31857eefea5ca7892892a87da44ef0520dc351bf67fb76aaa546a91388bdf","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789019185718,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"0b2ff538b9772e84a7b00d064514c31ace6648df80270cfc0720ead7dd9bbe3e","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/0b2ff538b9772e84a7b00d064514c31ace6648df80270cfc0720ead7dd9bbe3e","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: mcp-skill\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle contains only metadata and documentation files (`_meta.json`, `SKILL.md`, `README.md`). The `SKILL.md` describes the skill's purpose as wrapping the MCP at `https://mcp.exa.ai/mcp` and lists several research-oriented tools. There is no executable code, no instructions for the agent to perform any malicious actions (e.g., data exfiltration, unauthorized network calls, shell commands), and no prompt injection attempts. The mentioned URL is a legitimate domain associated with Exa.ai.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779160017217},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"SAFE","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1789019185718},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a small MCP wrapper for Exa research/search tools, with no local code, install scripts, persistence, or hidden instructions found.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Use of an external MCP endpoint is proportionate for search and research, but user queries and any supplied context may be sent to Exa when these tools are used.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No executable install mechanism, dependency file, script, or local runtime code was present in the artifact.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill instructions are brief and disclose the external MCP endpoint and included tools; no prompt hijacking, role changes, safety overrides, or unrelated instructions were present.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"No persistence, privilege escalation, background workers, scheduled tasks, local credential access, or tool replacement behavior was found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is to wrap the Exa MCP endpoint for web search, crawling, code context, company research, LinkedIn search, and deep research tools; these capabilities match that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install this only if you are comfortable routing search, research, crawling, and related prompts through Exa's MCP service. Avoid sending secrets or private code unless you have reviewed Exa's terms and your workspace policy allows that data flow.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789019185718}}}}}